  "name": "Wadi Halam II — Grazing Ground",
  "town": "wadi_halam",
  "phase": "foothold",
  "target_minutes": 7,
  "briefing": "Push through to the pasture and dig in while the engineers lay the crossing behind you. It is open grazing, crossed by long earth bunds in bands — real cover if you hold it, and the Rif know the ground as well as you do. Technicals and motorcycles will come at the pump house off the north, south and east edges in waves, and a short tree line in the north-west corner is the only ford; keep a watch on it. Accumulate five minutes of uncontested pasture and the corridor is yours. There is a shed on the pasture's western edge and it is his forward store — it comes down inside the same five minutes, and the pump house with it.",
  "briefing_sections": [
    {"id": "mission", "text": "Push through to the pasture and dig in while the engineers lay the crossing behind you."},
